I created an idea for an inclusive learning plartform designed to support people living with disabilities who stay at home. The plartform focuses on making learning more accessible by using digital technology and AI-Supported tools . The purpose of this project is to create learning opportunites for people who may face challenges accessing tradional learning environments . It features accesssible learning materials , online learning from home , simple and user-friendly design , AI-Supported learning , Oppurtunities to learn new skills. Skills used , Artificial Intelligence , Information Technology , Digital skills , Problem solving , creativity and User-focused thinking.this project helped me understand how technology can be used to create more inclusive opportunities and solve real-world problem .I learned that technology can be designed not only for convenience , but also to help people access education and develop useful skills .Future improvements i would like to develop this idea further by creating a working plartform with accessible features , learning resources and AI tools that can support different users .
